$ PBAR with I12^2 = I1*I2 exactly (mm units so the products are exact), which makes I1*I2 - I12^2 zero.
$ This must be a fatal error with no solution.
SOL 101
CEND
TITLE = 101_bar_i12_degenerate
ECHO = NONE
SPC = 1
LOAD = 1
DISPLACEMENT = ALL
SPCFORCES = ALL
STRESS = ALL
ELFORCE = ALL
BEGIN BULK
PARAM,POST,-1
MAT1,1,200000.0,,0.3,0.0,0.0,0.0
PBAR,1,1,10.,1.0,4.0,5.,,,+P1
+P1,1.,1.,-1.,1.,-1.,-1.,1.,-1.,+P2
+P2,,,2.0
GRID,1,,0.,0.,0.0
GRID,2,,50.,0.,0.0
GRID,3,,100.,0.,0.0
CBAR,1,1,1,2,0.0,1.0,0.0
CBAR,2,1,2,3,0.0,1.0,0.0
SPC1,1,123456,1
FORCE,1,3,,1.0,0.0,1.0,1.0
ENDDATA
